cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "HA-PIT: Ageing-Aware Physics-Informed Transformer for Battery State-of-Charge Estimation"
abstract: >-
  A multi-scale convolutional front end feeding two self-attention blocks,
  trained with a five-term physics-informed loss built on a first-order
  Thevenin equivalent-circuit model. The network predicts a residual
  correction on a Coulomb-counting anchor rather than absolute SOC. Capacity
  and internal resistance inside the physics constraint are recalibrated as
  the cell ages, from fresh to a 1.4 Ah end-of-life threshold.
type: software
